<title>RUSSIA: Noyabrksneftegaz cuts pref div, raises capital.</title>
<headline>Noyabrksneftegaz cuts pref div, raises capital.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian oil company Noyabrskneftegaz will pay a dividend on preferred shares of 537.75 roubles per 200-rouble share for 1996 after 661 roubles for 1995, parent Sibneft said on Wednesday. No dividend will be paid on ordinary shares for 1996, as for 1995.</p>
<p>A Sibneft spokesman told Reuters that shareholders had agreed to raise Noyabrskneftegaz's authorised but unissued capital to 30.85 trillion roubles from 15.71 billion roubles.</p>
</text>
